  "Delitele nuly nie sú (stupeň súčinu je súčet stupňov), invertibilné sú však len nenulové konštanty – napr. $x$ inverz nemá.": "There are no zero divisors (the degree of a product is the sum of the degrees), but only the nonzero constants are invertible – e.g. $x$ has no inverse.",
  "Delitele nuly sú nenulové $a, b$ s $ab = 0$. Vieš také konkrétne nájsť?": "Zero divisors are nonzero $a, b$ with $ab = 0$. Can you find specific ones?",
  "Delíme pod sebou, koeficienty redukujeme modulo ${@0}$: {@1}. Podiel je $q={@2}$ a zvyšok $r={@3}$, teda $r_1={@4}$, $r_0={@5}$.": "We divide using long division, reducing the coefficients modulo ${@0}$: {@1}. The quotient is $q={@2}$ and the remainder is $r={@3}$, so $r_1={@4}$, $r_0={@5}$.",
  "Dosadením do kongruencie modulo ${@0}$: ${@1}+{@2}t\\equiv {@3}$, teda ${@4}t\\equiv {@5} \\pmod{{@6}}$; inverz k ${@7}$ je ${@8}$, preto $t\\equiv {@9}$": "Substituting into the congruence modulo ${@0}$: ${@1}+{@2}t\\equiv {@3}$, so ${@4}t\\equiv {@5} \\pmod{{@6}}$; the inverse of ${@7}$ is ${@8}$, so $t\\equiv {@9}$",
