  "Všetky doterajšie riešenia sú $x={@0}+{@1}t$.": "All solutions so far are $x={@0}+{@1}t$.",
  "Všetky riešenia sú $x={@0}+{@1}k$, $y={@2}-{@3}k$; podmienku $0\\leq x&lt;{@4}$ spĺňa $x={@5}$ (vtedy $y={@6}$).": "All solutions are $x={@0}+{@1}k$, $y={@2}-{@3}k$; the condition $0\\leq x&lt;{@4}$ is satisfied by $x={@5}$ (then $y={@6}$).",
  "Z prvej kongruencie $x = {@0} + {@1}t$. Po dosadení do druhej dostaneš ${@2}t\\equiv c \\pmod{{@3}}$. Urči $c$ ako číslo z $\\{0, \\dots, {@4}\\}$.": "From the first congruence, $x = {@0} + {@1}t$. Substituting into the second gives ${@2}t\\equiv c \\pmod{{@3}}$. Find $c$ as a number from $\\{0, \\dots, {@4}\\}$.",
  "Z prvej kongruencie $x={@0}+{@1}t$.": "From the first congruence, $x={@0}+{@1}t$.",
